repository-code: "https://github.com/salahealer9/e8-globe-viewer"
abstract: "Interactive 3D globe viewer displaying E8 lattice edge network alignment with a 157-site catalog, with per-seed search-aware null distributions, BH-FDR status, per-site supported-edge counts, and a camera-synchronized comparison mode, from the v4.0 pre-registered confirmatory phase."
